Regression test for the spawning algorithm 
that should trigger this condition:

 ----------- FMS.out --------------
 --Time:       0.00 Timestep:   0.25 (  1 trajectory)
********************
SPAWNING: Trajectory   1 exceeded threshold
Parent on state  2 spawning to state  1
  time    coup    overlap  new
    0.25   0.0523 0.550
 Spawn fail : coupling dropped below threshold
              and no child could be created
 ----------------------------------

&control
! Integration and numerics
 TimeStep=2.0
 SimulationTime=4.1

 CSThresh=5.2298268030569E-002
 CFThresh=5.2298268030569E-002

! Initialization
 InitState=2
 InitialCond='NoSample'
 iRndSeed=57034456

! Simulation Properties
 Model='TOY'
 iMethod=3 ! Izmaylov model
 NumParticles=2
 NumStates=2
 NumInitBasis=1

! Input for Izmaylov model
 IzmOmegax=0.009557
 IzmOmegay=0.003515
 IzmXshift=20.07
 IzmYshift=0.0
 IzmDeltaE=0.01984
 IzmCoupC=0.0006127

! Spawning
 MultiSpawn=1		!number of spawns per event
 MaxTraj=5		!max number of trajectories
 OMax=0.6
 SpawnCoupV=.false.
 PopToSpawn=0.001
 CoupTimeStep=0.250
/ !Atom type information below
  2 ! number of atom types
#Name  AtomicNum  AtomicWeight(amu) Width(1/bohr**2)
 QQ    1       0.0005485      0.004775
 PP    1       0.0005485      0.001675
